/* textmenu.rcss - TextMenu layout, from the old
   abcenchance/res/TextMenuPanel.res (xpos 8, ypos c-216, rounded
   PaintBackgroundType 2 box). CTextMenu never calls SetProportional, so its
   anchors are RAW PIXELS, not design units: c-216 = screenH/2 - 216px
   (y=324 @1080p, left-centre-up) and xpos 8 = 8px - 96dp/3.5dp in the dp
   space. The old CTextMenu::SetContent resized the box to the text every
   message (w*1.1/h*1.1), so the shipped look is a snug panel hugging the
   menu text - reproduce with an auto-sized box and a small padding. */

#textmenu {
	position: absolute;
	left: 3.5dp;
	top: 50%;
	width: auto;
	height: auto;
	margin-top: -96dp;
	/* Old TextMenu.BgColor 0 0 0 64 + the rounded PaintBackgroundType 2. */
	background-color: #00000040;
	border-radius: 5dp;
	transition: opacity 0.2s linear-in;
}

#textmenu #menu {
	/* Old LabelEx: textAlignment north-west, 10% box padding (w*1.1). */
	padding: 2dp 5dp;
	/* Old TextMenu.TextColor 222 222 222 222; menu text keeps newlines. */
	color: #dededede;
	white-space: pre-wrap;
}
